        "title": "Enabling Multi Factor Authentication for User Association via Dashboard",
        "body": "Multi-Factor Authentication for User Association is not available for associating federated accounts or for associating local accounts using the dashboard association gadget.\r\nThere is a possibility of security attacks if an attacker already has an account in the system with login permission (if self-signup is enabled) due to not having MFA with User Association.\r\n\r\nTherefore, the need of having MFA for User Association via the Dashboard has been raised.\r\n",
